    <summary>
            The input audio noise reduction mode.
            <list type="bullet"><item><description>`azure_deep_noise_suppression_headset`: Azure headset-optimized noise suppression for local voice activity detection. Optimized for low-sample-rate audio, including 8 kHz telephony audio. Enhances detection audio without changing the audio used for recognition. The mode is not restricted to headset devices.</description></item><item><description>`azure_personal_noise_suppression`: Azure personalized noise suppression for local voice activity detection. Starts with headset suppression and personalizes detection after automatic speaker enrollment. Recognition audio is unchanged; headset suppression remains active when personalization is unavailable.</description></item></list></summary>
